OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FFirefighters in southwest France are
OL,8,Fstill battling an uncontained wildfire
OL,9,Ffour times the size of Paris.
OL,11,FThey are working in extreme
OL,12,Fconditions, with temperatures expected
OL,13,Fto climb above 40 degrees Celsius (104
OL,14,Fdegrees Fahrenheit) on Wednesday.
OL,16,FMeteo-France said Wednesday would be
OL,17,Fthe hottest and driest day of the
OL,18,Fweek, with elevated wildfire danger
OL,19,Facross every region of France.
