OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785347312
OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FDrought now covers mainland France and
OL,8,FCorsica, with soils nearing the record
OL,9,Fdryness reached in August 2022.
OL,11,FSmoke from the Gironde and Landes
OL,12,Ffires also pushed particulate
OL,13,Fpollution higher across both
OL,14,Fdepartments, regional air-quality
OL,15,Fmonitors said.
OL,17,FThe heat wave and forecast winds in
OL,18,Fthe Gironde region around Bordeaux
OL,19,Fcould hamper progress against a blaze
OL,20,Fthat has forced 220,000 people from
OL,21,Ftheir homes, authorities said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
