OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785347312
OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FWhile the blaze hasn't spread any
OL,8,Ffurther, they are warning with
OL,9,Ftemperatures forecast to hit 40C, it
OL,10,Fcould cause smoldering hot spots,
OL,11,Fcarry embers across firebreaks and
OL,12,Fopen new fronts beyond crews' reach.
OL,14,FInvestigators believe routine brush-
OL,15,Fclearing work near a high-voltage line
OL,16,Fmay have sparked the inferno, even
OL,17,Fthough the work appeared to comply
OL,18,Fwith regulations then in force.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
