OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FIn Spain, firefighters have stabilized
OL,8,Fforest fires burning in the Madrid
OL,9,Fregion and province of Avila, Spain's
OL,10,FInterior Minister Fernando Grande-
OL,11,FMarlaska said.
OL,13,FAuthorities lifted all evacuation
OL,14,Forders in Avila and in additional
OL,15,Fvillages affected in the Madrid region.
OL,17,FHowever, 10,000 people are still under
OL,18,Fevacuation orders due to a wildfire in
OL,19,FCastellon, in eastern Spain, that
OL,20,Fauthorities said was still not under
OL,21,Fcontrol.
