OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,8,Furged caution as much of the country
OL,9,Fwas baking under a fourth heatwave
OL,10,Fthat began Wednesday.
OL,12,FAcross France and Spain, roughly
OL,13,F330,000 people have been driven from
OL,14,Fhomes and vacation sites by wildfires.
OL,16,FMeanwhile, two firefighters have died
OL,17,Fin a wildfire on the southern Greek
OL,18,Fisland of Crete, according to local
OL,19,Fauthorities.
