OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FThey were among more than 150 crews
OL,8,Fbattling a wildfire in the region of
OL,9,FRethymno on Wednesday.
OL,11,F"They fell heroically in the line of
OL,12,Fduty to protect the lives and property
OL,13,Fof citizens and the natural
OL,14,Fenvironment," the fire department said
OL,15,Fin a written statement.
