OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FThe flames were being fanned by strong
OL,8,Fwinds in the area, which was hampering
OL,9,Ffirefighting efforts. Four helicopters
OL,10,Fand four water-dropping planes were
OL,11,Falso deployed according to the fire
OL,12,Fdepartment.
OL,14,FEvacuation orders were issued for
OL,15,Fseveral areas near the fire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
