OL,3,CFirefighters continue to tackle
OL,4,Cmassive blaze in France as
OL,5,Ctemperatures soar
OL,7,FThe circumstances of the two deaths
OL,8,Fwere not immediately clear, but local
OL,9,Fmedia said initial reports indicated
OL,10,Fthat the two were trapped in their
OL,11,Fvehicle after becoming disoriented by
OL,12,Fthe smoke.
